@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed LC-09 artifact accounting and protection identities
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #164E63
top to bottom direction
class EffectiveFilePolicy
class QuotaReservation {
 +reservationId : ReservationId
 +contextAndCategory : QuotaContext
 +actualState : AccountingState
}
class ArtifactRecord {
 +artifactId : ArtifactId
 +version : RevisionId
 +availability : ActualAvailability
}
class ProtectedReference {
 +referenceId : ReferenceId
 +consumerIdentity : OwnerResourceVersion
 +protection : ActualProtectionState
}
class ReclamationAttempt
class RecoveryAssessment
EffectiveFilePolicy -- QuotaReservation : effective admission guard
QuotaReservation -- ArtifactRecord : attributable finalization
ArtifactRecord -- ProtectedReference : excludes unsafe reclamation
ArtifactRecord -- ReclamationAttempt : actual deletion evidence
RecoveryAssessment ..> ArtifactRecord : covered consistency / usability
note bottom of ProtectedReference
 Provisional uncertainty remains protected until reconciled.
 Metadata, usable bytes and reclaimed capacity are distinct.
 Final physical schema/cardinalities remain to refine.
end note
@enduml
